
### 01 - Authorization
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}


### 02 - Create User
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/admin/users
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
      "password": "Test1234$",
  "role": "USER"
}


### 03 - Create Account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6VGVzdDEyMzQk


### 04 - Get Accounts
GET http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/accounts
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6VGVzdDEyMzQk


### 01 - Deposit - Positive - Valid Amount
### 01 - Пополнение счёта - Позитивный - Допустимая сумма
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6VGVzdDEyMzQk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": 100.5
}


### 02 - Deposit - Negative - Zero Amount
### 02 - Пополнение счёта - Негативный - Нулевая сумма
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Authorization: Basic dGVzdHVzZXI6VGVzdDEyMzQk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": 0
}


